sequenceDiagram
  participant B as Local burst probe
  participant I as Inventory API
  participant O as Orders API
  participant P as Payment simulator
  participant F as Fulfillment simulator
  participant K as Kafka/History
  participant R as Result report

  B->>I: Read SKU availability and add keyed safety stock if needed
  B->>O: Submit bounded concurrent unique checkouts
  O-->>B: Accepted order IDs and request latencies
  O->>P: Simulated authorize/capture
  O->>I: Reserve then commit stock
  O->>F: Schedule simulated fulfillment
  O->>K: Publish lifecycle outbox events
  B->>O: Poll each owned order to terminal state
  B->>I: Verify nonnegative SKU availability
  B->>K: Verify consumer lag returns to zero
  B->>R: Persist latency, memory, counts and limits locally
